  "activities": "Making Products That Fly\n\nA sophisticated facility manned by a globally experienced team, which provides fully-finished components precision-machined through fully-finished. A one-stop shop for precision-engineered products to global OEMs, manufactured and delivered on time, every time.\n\nWe have an experienced team of engineers capable of making challenging machined components in a brand-new state of the art facility in Bangalore, India. Within our one stop shop we can manufacture, treat, plate, paint and test a part without leaving our location.\n\nWe deliver quality and shorter supply chains to discerning clients in the Aerospace, Medical and Oil & Gas industries.\n\nCutting-edge Quality Standards\n\n    AS9100 REV B, passed in June 2011\n    AS9100 REV C, passed May 2012\n    NADCAP (NDT), certification received September 2012\n    NADCAP (Chemical Processing), certification received October 2012\n    Numerous global OEM approvals\n    Lean Six-Sigma training\n\nExperienced teams on each project\n\nOur team of engineers is among the best in the industry, with plenty of global experience. And each of our clients is provided with a program manager as a point of contact and accountability through all phases of planning and production, who in turn is empowered to internally manage cross-functional teams. We have an extensive list of special processes, with a Level 3 NDT NAS410 on-site.\n\nStreamlined Processes\n\nOur customers benefit from efficiencies in operational methods, leading to lower cycle times. We utilize effective Supply Chain Management to meet customer expectations of on-time delivery.\n\nPrecision Machining Center\nIn addition to the strict quality standards we adhere to, we have concentrated on cost effectiveness and on extending our range of machines. We have a wide range of CNC machines, all with a proven record of spare parts. We also have conventional machine to perform grinding and jig-boring operation.\n\nOur business model is designed to meet the portfolio of parts that global OEMs will source in India. Our plan is to own and operate 75 CNC machines by the end of FY 2015.\n\nSpecial Processes Plant \nThis facility caters to all third-party customers with a broad range of special processes under one roof.\n\nOur facility is growing rapidly, and adding new capabilities in a very short span of time. Please contact us to understand our current state of completion and new capabilities that we plan to add.\n\nProcessing Capabilities\n\nNon-destructive testing\nChemical Processing\nSurface Cleaning\nSpray Paining\nLaborotary Capabilities\nHeat Treatment",
